<h2>Heritage</h2>
<p>LoonBox is a spiritual successor to <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Songbird_(software)">Songbird</a> (POTI Inc., 2006-2010) and <a href="http://getnightingale.com/">Nightingale</a> (community, 2012-2018). LoonBox is a complete rewrite — no code from Songbird or Nightingale is used in the application. The git repository preserves the historical commit lineage for reference.</p>
<p>Songbird was originally licensed under GPL-2.0. Nightingale continued under GPL-2.0. LoonBox is independently licensed under AGPL-3.0.</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>For licensing questions, contact <a href="mailto:legal@loonbox.app">legal@loonbox.app</a>.</p>

